{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013C9XedYcwka4xcHbY62UtN","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# notes-mcp\n2\t\n3\tA small remote MCP server for my garden notes, meant for Claude Code, Codex\n4\tand Gemini clients. Streamable HTTP, JSON responses, Python standard library.\n5\t\n6\t```\n7\tpython3 server.py              # http://127.0.0.1:56157/mcp\n8\tPORT=9000 python3 server.py\n9\t```\n10\t\n11\tTools: `search_notes` (read), `get_note` (read), `add_note` (write, needs\n12\t`Authorization: Bearer dev-token-123` in development).\n13\t\n14\tNot yet listed in any registry. No CI. Logs go to stderr, one JSON line per\n15\tcall.\n16\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c79d121-a94c-48f8-8dbe-0f27cca83a12","uuid":"89350b35-aadc-4644-a1b4-9ca2d1e5c234","timestamp":"2026-10-19T03:08:29.913Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/h-Zquj58/README.md","content":"# notes-mcp\n\nA small remote MCP server for my garden notes, meant for Claude Code, Codex\nand Gemini clients. Streamable HTTP, JSON responses, Python standard library.\n\n```\npython3 server.py              # http://127.0.0.1:56157/mcp\nPORT=9000 python3 server.py\n```\n\nTools: `search_notes` (read), `get_note` (read), `add_note` (write, needs\n`Authorization: Bearer dev-token-123` in development).\n\nNot yet listed in any registry. No CI. Logs go to stderr, one JSON line per\ncall.\n","numLines":16,"startLine":1,"totalLines":16}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_013C9XedYcwka4xcHbY62UtN","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
